<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.custody.unlocks ~ unlock opens custody; the route rides a TTY

`lares vault unlock` gathers a route on the terminal and hands it to the standing vessel's custody door, which opens the vessel key (`--face N`: that face's key under its own route; `--all`: every face its routes open). The door reads first: a vessel standing by a pūlama takes no route here and asks the pūlama; a key already held takes no second route and points at `lares wear N`; `--face N` on a held key wears N where it stands open, and refuses a face the vessel holds nowhere. A face that lights lands its shares. A credential rides a TTY alone: no flag, no environment variable and no pipe carries one, nothing echoes one, and it drops the instant the act returns.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ unlock · one-face · every-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`unlock` params=`~ open the vessel key`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-face` params=`face/2 ~ open face h2 under its own route`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`every-face` params=`all/true ~ open every face the routes open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · all

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face to open under its own route, by persona index`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`~ open every face the gathered routes open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the route at their own terminal; an AI seat names the command`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · custody-probe-unread · pulama-waits · face-not-standing · offline-beside-pulama · daemon-unreachable · no-slot-opens · attempts-spent · face-refused · face-not-named · tree-absent · tree-unreadable · root-unopenable · unlock-incomplete · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.custody.unlocks face/2]] ~ --face names a handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`custody-probe-unread` params=`~ the house names a pūlama and its custody probe went unread; nothing was asked`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`pulama-waits` params=`~ the pūlama keeps custody and waits on its own hand door; the line names its next act`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-standing` params=`cure/[[face.custody.unlocks face/2]] ~ the vessel holds no face of that index; nothing was asked`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`offline-beside-pulama` params=`~ no vessel answers and a pūlama keeps custody; stand the vessel, then unlock through it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`cure/[[face.custody.unlocks]] ~ the vessel stopped answering before the unlock landed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`no-slot-opens` params=`cure/[[face.custody.unlocks]] ~ the route typed opens no slot; a try spent`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`attempts-spent` params=`~ this boot's unlock tries ran out; restand the vessel`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-refused` params=`~ the face refused to light under the route`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-named` params=`~ no face of that index stands in the floor index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`tree-absent` params=`~ no slot tree stands to open`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`tree-unreadable` params=`~ the slot tree does not read`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-unopenable` params=`~ the face's root does not open`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`unlock-incomplete` params=`~ the door answered a reading this door does not know`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

